  ('aggie-football', 'published', 'Former Aggies Defensive Star Sam Adams Named 2026 SEC Football Legend', '<p>COLLEGE STATION — Sam Adams, one of the top defensive players in Texas A&amp;M history, will be honored as the Aggies'' 2026 SEC Football Legend, the Southeastern Conference and Texas A&amp;M announced.</p><img src="/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-04.webp" alt="Kyle Field at Texas A&amp;M University in College Station at dusk (file photo, 2024). Photo: Iain Cridland / Unsplash"><p><em>▲ Kyle Field at Texas A&amp;M University in College Station at dusk (file photo, 2024). Photo: Iain Cridland / Unsplash</em></p><p>Adams played for the Aggies from 1991 to 1993 under coach R.C. Slocum, who was Texas A&amp;M''s SEC Legend in 2025. He lettered three times and was a three-time All-Southwest Conference pick, according to Texas A&amp;M Athletics.</p><p>He was the SWC Defensive Newcomer of the Year and a first-team Freshman All-American in his first season and became a consensus All-American as a junior. In that junior year he made 78 tackles, including 13 for loss and 10.5 sacks, and forced five fumbles, the athletics department said. He was named Sports Illustrated''s national defensive player of the year and SWC Defensive Player of the Year and was a Lombardi Award finalist.</p><p>Texas A&amp;M went 30-4-1 in Adams'' three seasons and won three straight SWC championships.</p><p>The Seattle Seahawks drafted Adams eighth overall in 1994. He played 14 NFL seasons with the Seahawks, Ravens, Raiders, Bills, Bengals and Broncos, made three Pro Bowls, earned two All-Pro honors and won Super Bowl XXXV with the Ravens, the school said.</p><p>Adams also competed in the shot put and discus for the Aggie track team and was inducted into the Texas A&amp;M Athletics Hall of Fame in 2001.</p><p>Earlier Texas A&amp;M SEC Legends include John David Crow, Dat Nguyen, Jacob Green, Johnny Manziel, Ray Childress and Luke Joeckel, according to the release.</p><p><em>※ This article was written with the help of AI, based on public and official sources.</em></p>', 'Sam Adams, a consensus All-American on Texas A&M teams that won three straight Southwest Conference titles, will represent the Aggies as the SEC''s 2026 Football Legend, the school said.', '/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-04.webp', '2026-10-08T14:00:00-05:00'::timestamptz, array['Texas A&M football','Sam Adams','SEC Legends','Aggie history']::text[], '• 확인할 점: The release does not say when or where Adams will be honored (SEC Legends are traditionally recognized around the SEC Championship Game); not included. Add once the SEC announces details.
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Sam Adams Named 2026 SEC Football Legend (Oct. 8, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/8/sam-adams-named-2026-sec-football-legend
• 이용 조건: Text: facts from Texas A&M Athletics (12thman.com) releases, rewritten; quotes as published by the athletics department / Photo: Unsplash License, Iain Cridland / Unsplash, https://unsplash.com/photos/a-stadium-with-a-cloudy-sky-in-the-background-p1d1ufnbHS4
