  ('aggie-football', 'published', 'Texas A&M Shuts Out The Citadel 41-0 Behind Morrow''s Three Touchdowns', '<p>COLLEGE STATION — Texas A&amp;M beat The Citadel 41-0 on Saturday afternoon at Kyle Field, piling up 501 yards of offense and recording its second shutout of the season, according to Texas A&amp;M Athletics.</p><img src="/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-02.webp" alt="Texas A&amp;M football players run onto the field at Kyle Field between lines of cadets (file photo, 2025; not from Saturday&#x27;s game against The Citadel). Photo: Charlie Schroeder / Unsplash"><p><em>▲ Texas A&amp;M football players run onto the field at Kyle Field between lines of cadets (file photo, 2025; not from Saturday''s game against The Citadel). Photo: Charlie Schroeder / Unsplash</em></p><p>Sophomore running back Jamarion Morrow scored on three runs, all in the first half, and finished with 54 yards on eight carries. The three rushing touchdowns were a career high, and the athletics department said he is the first Aggie running back to score three times on the ground in a game since Le''Veon Moss at Notre Dame in 2025.</p><p>KJ Edwards led the team in rushing and became the first Texas A&amp;M player this season to go over 100 yards in a game, the school said. The Aggies ran for 264 yards and passed for 237.</p><p>Senior quarterback Marcel Reed, making his 25th consecutive start, completed 8 of 13 passes for 130 yards, including a 37-yard touchdown to freshman Aaron Gregory. Sophomore Brady Hart played the second half and went 8 of 12 for 107 yards, hitting Gregory for a 12-yard score in the fourth quarter. Gregory became the first Aggie freshman with two touchdown catches in a game since 2025, according to the release. Kicker David Olano added field goals of 23 and 20 yards in the third quarter.</p><p>The defense held The Citadel to 183 total yards and under 100 passing yards. Senior linebacker Ray Coney had seven tackles in the first half, and senior safety Tawfiq Byard also had seven tackles with a team-high 1.5 tackles for loss. The athletics department said it is the first time since 1993 that Texas A&amp;M has shut out two opponents in the same season.</p><p>"Coming off the field today, we were able to get done what we wanted to get done," head coach Mike Elko said after the game, according to remarks posted by the athletics department. He said playing time for younger players "was really, really important with where we are right now."</p><p>Gregory said the offense played as "one unit." The win improved Texas A&amp;M to 4-3 overall, according to the team''s schedule; the nonconference game did not affect its 1-3 SEC record. The Aggies play at Alabama on Saturday, Oct. 24, with a 2:30 p.m. kickoff on ABC.</p><p><em>※ This article was written with the help of AI, based on public and official sources.</em></p>', 'Jamarion Morrow ran for three touchdowns and the Texas A&M defense posted its second shutout of the season as the Aggies beat The Citadel 41-0 at Kyle Field on Saturday.', '/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-02.webp', '2026-10-17T18:40:00-05:00'::timestamptz, array['Texas A&M football','The Citadel','Kyle Field','Jamarion Morrow','Aggies']::text[], '• 확인할 점: KJ Edwards'' rushing total differs between official sources: the game recap says 111 yards on 12 carries; the Alabama game-week notes say 116 yards. Story says only ''over 100 yards''. The recap calls Edwards a sophomore while other releases call him a freshman, so no class is given.
• 확인할 점: Elko quote ''was really, really important with where we are right now'' is a fragment of a longer remark; the full sentence in the release is ''That was really, really important with where we are right now.''
• 확인할 점: 4-3 record computed from the official schedule results (W 50-0, W 48-20, L 21-31, L 6-35, W 34-7, L 6-27, W 41-0); release itself does not state the record.
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Aggies vs. The Citadel game recap (Oct. 17, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/17/aggies-vs-the-citadel
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Alabama Game Week: Press Conference and Game Notes (Oct. 19, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/19/alabama-game-week-press-conference-and-game-notes
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — 2026 Football Schedule (accessed Oct. 27, 2026)): https://12thman.com/sports/football/schedule
