  ('basketball', 'published', 'Aggie Men Open SEC Play Jan. 2 vs. Auburn; 10 Games Set for ESPN Networks', '<p>COLLEGE STATION — The Texas A&amp;M men''s basketball team will open Southeastern Conference play at home against Auburn at 7:30 p.m. Saturday, Jan. 2, on SEC Network, under tip times and TV assignments released by the SEC and ESPN.</p><img src="/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-06.webp" alt="A basketball hoop and net seen from below (file photo). It is not Texas A&amp;M&#x27;s arena. Photo: Igor Batista / Unsplash"><p><em>▲ A basketball hoop and net seen from below (file photo). It is not Texas A&amp;M''s arena. Photo: Igor Batista / Unsplash</em></p><p>The Aggies are set to play 10 games on ESPN, ESPN2 or ESPNU and 14 on SEC Network, with seven more nonconference games streaming on SEC Network+, according to Texas A&amp;M Athletics.</p><p>Home SEC games against Arkansas, Tennessee and Vanderbilt are scheduled for the ESPN family of networks, as are road games at Florida, Vanderbilt, Texas and Kentucky, the athletics department said.</p><p>Texas A&amp;M''s 18-game league schedule includes nine games at Reed Arena: Auburn on Jan. 2, Arkansas on Jan. 12, LSU on Jan. 16, Tennessee on Jan. 26, Oklahoma on Feb. 2, Georgia on Feb. 13, Vanderbilt on Feb. 20, Alabama on Feb. 23 and Texas on March 6, the regular-season finale. The Aggies play at Texas on Feb. 17. The SEC Tournament is scheduled for March 10-14 at Bridgestone Arena in Nashville.</p><p>Before conference play, the Aggies host Stanford at 8:15 p.m. Wednesday, Dec. 2, on ESPNU in the SEC/ACC Challenge. They play Florida State on Saturday, Dec. 12, at Toyota Center in Houston, and the schedule lists December home games against UAPB, Holy Cross, North Florida and Prairie View.</p><p>Over Thanksgiving, Texas A&amp;M returns to the Battle 4 Atlantis in the Bahamas for the first time since the 2015-16 season. The Aggies face Xavier at 1:30 p.m. Wednesday, Nov. 25, on ESPN2 and Marquette at 4 p.m. Friday, Nov. 27, on SEC Network.</p><p>The Nov. 12 home game against Oklahoma State, a 7 p.m. tip on SEC Network+, is listed on the schedule as an Operation Blackout game. The season opens Nov. 3 against Alabama State at Reed Arena.</p><p><em>※ This article was written with the help of AI, based on public and official sources.</em></p>', 'Texas A&M men''s basketball will play 10 games on ESPN networks and 14 on SEC Network, opening league play Jan. 2 at Reed Arena against Auburn and closing the regular season at home against Texas.', '/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-sp-06.webp', '2026-10-22T11:20:00-05:00'::timestamptz, array['Texas A&M basketball','SEC schedule','Reed Arena','Battle 4 Atlantis','Bucky McMillan']::text[], '• 확인할 점: TV designations and tip times come from the Oct. 7 release; game dates for the full SEC slate come from the official schedule page accessed Oct. 27. Times may change.
• 확인할 점: The Dec. 12 Florida State game time (2 p.m.) on the schedule page is not in the release, so it is left out.
• 확인할 점: Times are as listed by Texas A&M Athletics (presumably Central).
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — Men''s Basketball Finalizes 2026-27 Schedule (Oct. 7, 2026)): https://12thman.com/news/2026/10/7/mens-basketball-finalizes-2026-27-schedule
• 원문(Texas A&M Athletics — 2026-27 Men''s Basketball Schedule (accessed Oct. 27, 2026)): https://12thman.com/sports/mens-basketball/schedule
