  ('business', 'published', 'Waffle House Submits Plans for First Bryan-College Station Location', '<p>BRYAN — Waffle House submitted plans Monday to build a restaurant at Rudder''s Landing, a commercial development in West Bryan, the City of Bryan said in a news release the same day.</p><img src="/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-bz-01.webp" alt="A waffle topped with butter (file photo, 2017). It is not from Waffle House or the planned Bryan restaurant. Photo: Jodie Morgan / Unsplash"><p><em>▲ A waffle topped with butter (file photo, 2017). It is not from Waffle House or the planned Bryan restaurant. Photo: Jodie Morgan / Unsplash</em></p><p>Rudder''s Landing is anchored by a Walmart store and sits near the intersection of West Villa Maria Road and Harvey Mitchell Parkway, according to the city.</p><p>The restaurant would be the Georgia-based chain''s first in the Bryan-College Station area, the city said. Its nearest current locations are in Conroe and Cypress, about 70 miles away.</p><p>The city said residents had asked for the restaurant for years and that it had received development requests over that time.</p><p>"There is no better place for Waffle House''s next expansion than Bryan, Texas," Bryan Mayor Bobby Gutierrez said in the release. He said the city''s discussions with the company had been "enjoyable, productive and beneficial."</p><p>Waffle House Inc. will set the timelines for starting and finishing construction later, the city said. The release did not say whether the city offered any incentives, how many jobs the restaurant would create or how large the building would be.</p><p><em>※ This article was written with the help of AI, based on public and official sources.</em></p>', 'Waffle House filed plans Oct. 26 for a restaurant at Rudder''s Landing in West Bryan, the City of Bryan said. It would be the chain''s first location in the Bryan-College Station area.', '/sites/breakingbcs/photos/bcs2-bz-01.webp', '2026-10-27T08:20:00-05:00'::timestamptz, array['Bryan','restaurants','development','Rudder''s Landing']::text[], '• 확인할 점: The release gives no opening date, job count, building size or incentive details; Waffle House Inc. will set construction timelines later.
• 확인할 점: Plans were only submitted Oct. 26; city review/permit approval is still pending.
• 확인할 점: Photo is a generic food image, not the chain''s product or site.
• 원문(City of Bryan — Waffle House Submits Plans for New Location in Bryan (Oct. 26, 2026)): https://www.bryantx.gov/news/posts/waffle-house-submits-plans-for-new-location-in-bryan/
• 이용 조건: Text: facts rewritten from public government sources; no text copied / Photo: Unsplash License, Jodie Morgan / Unsplash, https://unsplash.com/photos/waffle-on-gray-ceramic-plate-v4IwVaaxoFo
